page for a consulting service with an appointment calendar, video testimonials, downloadable case studies, blog previews, and sleek corporate UI."},eliteFootwear:{label:"Elite Footwear",prompt:"Create a landing page for a luxury shoe brand with a sleek product carousel, size guide popup, live chat, testimonials, newsletter signup, and elegant minimal ui. use only relevant images."},smartCourse:{label:"Smart Course",prompt:"Create a landing page for an AI & Machine Learning course featuring syllabus, interactive preview, enrollment countdown, FAQ accordion, chatbot, and a clean modern responsive design."}},mobile:{flappyBirdGame:{label:"Flappy Bird Game",prompt:"Build a mobile-friendly, realistic Flappy Bird game with beautiful color accents, featuring Play, Pause, Resume, and High Score functionality."},recipeGenerator:{label:"Recipe Generator",prompt:"Build a mobile-first recipe generator app. No login required - users can add ingredients they have on hand and the app generates recipes based on those ingredients."},habitTracker:{label:"Habit Tracker",prompt:"Build a dopamine-boosting biohacker habit tracker mobile-first app for powerlifters, ravers, and professional athletes. Include daily checkboxes, streak tracking, calendar view, healthy recipe generator, share to social media button, and local storage. Use a clean, mobile-friendly Notion-style UI with soft colors, progress indicators, and light/dark mode toggle."},breathingSpace:{label:"Breathing Space",prompt:"Build a breathing exercise app with guided inhale/exhale animations, customizable patterns, session history, and soothing color transitions"}},brainstorm:{ideaExplorer:{label:"Idea explorer",prompt:"Help me brainstorm the product direction, user journeys, core features, and best MVP scope for this idea before we start building."},landingPageAngles:{label:"Landing page angles",prompt:"Brainstorm three sharp landing page concepts for this product, including target audience, messaging angle, sections, and a visual direction for each."},mvpGameplan:{label:"MVP gameplan",prompt:"Break this app idea into an MVP plan with features to keep, features to postpone, edge cases to watch, and a practical first version we can build quickly."},saasPrd:{label:"SaaS PRD",prompt:"Write a detailed product requirements document for a SaaS project management tool — cover target users, core features, user stories, technical constraints, and success metrics."},cloneBreakdown:{label:"Clone Breakdown",prompt:"Break down how Notion works — its core features, page structure, database system, and collaboration model — then outline an MVP plan to clone the essential parts."},userJourneyMap:{label:"User Journey Map",prompt:"Map out the complete user journey for an e-commerce app — from first visit to checkout — including key screens, decision points, drop-off risks, and UX recommendations."},featurePrioritization:{label:"Feature Prioritization",prompt:"Take this fitness tracking app idea and prioritize features using a MoSCoW framework — must-haves, should-haves, could-haves, and won't-haves for the first release."}}}},e6t={newTask:"New Task",deployedApps:"Deployed Apps",showcase:"Showcase",activeTasks:"Active Tasks",recentTasks:"Recent Tasks",buy:"Buy",buyCredits:"Buy Credits"},t6t={unnamedApp:"Unnamed App",noTaskAvailable:"No task available",untitled:"Untitled",resourcesDescription:"Manage your app's speed and memory usage",emptyState:{title:"0 apps deployed",description:"Deploy your application to a production-ready environment. This will make it publicly accessible with managed infrastructure",deploymentCosts:"Deployment costs",creditsPerMonth:"50 credits/month"},alt:{globe:"Globe",credits:"Credits"},card:{status:{deploying:"Deploying",live:"Live",failed:"Failed",unknown:"Unknown"},time:{secsAgo:"{{count}} sec ago",secsAgo_plural:"{{count}} secs ago",minsAgo:"{{count}} min ago",minsAgo_plural:"{{count}} mins ago",hrsAgo:"{{count}} hr ago",hrsAgo_plural:"{{count}} hrs ago",daysAgo:"{{count}} 